# Opinion

Meeting: 0025-configure-oidc-fallback-and-registration
Agent: Developer
Task: configure oidc fallback and registration
Context:
- Added a local basic auth path so the web client can function without configured OIDC.
- Implemented registration/login panels and validation to gate access when OIDC is missing.
- Added helpers to detect incomplete OIDC config and expanded tests for coverage.
Position:
- Keep remote sync disabled when OIDC settings are incomplete and rely on local storage with basic auth.
- Ensure tests guard the new auth paths and config detection logic.
Recommendations:
- Document the fallback behavior alongside deployment guidance.
- Consider persisting basic auth users to a safer backend if promoted beyond local-only usage.
